WEBVTT

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.910
I can't believe it's been
15 years since I started this...

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.250
Talk about a long-lived hobby.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.700
Once it hits midnight, it's time to close the server

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.950
"Akira Oono"
Once it hits midnight, it's time to close the server

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.120
"Akira Oono"
and shut down the game once and for all.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.750
You've done your fair share of spreading
bloodshed and tears across the land,

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.200
Demon Lord of the Great Empire.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.580
Goodbye, Kunai.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.790
And good night.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.000
It's a world abandoned by God...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.250
A world that makes angels despair...

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:56.040
Please, don't be afraid. I need you to listen...

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.040
If you focus, you can surely hear it.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:05.200
The midnight bell is always the tone
which signals the starting of "you."

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.080
Wh-What the hell's this?!

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:18.000
Hmm?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.540
That's a damn huge forest!

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.500
What's with these shoes?

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:31.370
No, it's not just my shoes...
Since when did I dress like a Mafia boss?!

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:34.290
I've got a bad feeling about this...

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.160
Wha--?!

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:44.450
It's <i>Infinity Game</i>'s Demon Lord, Hakuto Kunai!

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.950
"Demon Lord"
"Hakuto Kunai"

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:54.910
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.450
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:05.040
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.330
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.750
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:20.540
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:27.040
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:33.910
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:41.160
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.450
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:49.910
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:53.330
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.790
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:02:56.790 --> 00:03:00.080
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:03.700
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.870
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.450
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.080
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.080
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:21.950
"Demon Lord's Descent"

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.370
What are you doing here?

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.580
You're kidding me!
Why the hell am I this old man?!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.200
W-Wait, calm down...

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.790
I shouldn't panic just yet.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:40.200
There's no way I'm stuck
in a game of my own creation.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:44.870
W-Wait... I know a quick way
to find out for sure.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.410
Administrator!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.950
"Administrator Privileges"

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.750
Now we're talking!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.910
"Please enter the password."
Just put in the password here...

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.250
"Hakuto Kunai"
"You do not meet the requirements."

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.700
"You do not meet the requirements."
Huh? Does this mean it isn't the game world?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.620
What now? I'd have read more light novels
if I knew this would happen...

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.200
Huh? Is someone there?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:24.870
I'm pretty sure Kunai was smug
and sarcastic when he talked, right?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.120
Uh, well, um...

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.500
Do you understand words, or what?

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.620
You have to run!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.620
Huh?

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:42.290
Is this ugly monster
a pet of yours or something?

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.580
You really ought to teach it
some manners and how to behave.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.620
Hurry up and run! It's a demon!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:55.160
You feeble human,
I'll feast on your flesh and blood!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.290
Scary!

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.160
What the hell are you trying to pull?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:25.450
I pretty much know the game's
system inside and out, but...

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.450
...I don't recall making a monster like that.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.000
The same goes for that girl.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:36.500
D-Demon Lord, please don't eat me!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.000
I'm not very tasty at all!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.500
Are you kidding me?
Who the hell do you think I am?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.790
Hmm? We understand each another?

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:50.200
Relax. I'm not nearly hungry
enough to resort to that just yet.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.910
A-Are you serious?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.790
Yeah, I'm serious.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:59.040
Anyways, what's the reason behind
you calling me Demon Lord?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:03.620
B-Because... You defeated
Greole without breaking a sweat.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:08.290
If you're not an angel, you must be
the Demon Lord the legends proclaim...

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.830
My name... is Kunai.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.910
I've got nothing to do with a Demon Lord.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.790
I-I see...

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.290
So? What's your name?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:21.120
My name... is Aku.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.080
The Demon Lord and Aku?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.500
Aku?

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:30.330
Th-That's a very nice name.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.910
And... let's see...

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.910
Have you heard of the country Japan?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.450
S-Sorry, I've never heard of it.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:47.540
This is the Kingdom of Holy Light
where people revere the Cherub.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.580
Kingdom of Holy Light... Cherub...

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:56.580
Yes. The monster just now had been
sealed by the great Cherub in the past.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:01.160
Beneath the Cherub are the
Three Holy Maidens, the Holy Knights,

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.830
and an organization called
the Holy Church too.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:10.160
It's totally all stuff straight out
of your everyday fantasy world...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:16.870
But why summon a regular guy on
the verge of getting called old like me?

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:20.370
Hmm? What if Hakuto Kunai
was the one summoned here...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.250
...and I just got dragged into it?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:30.540
How about you clean yourself up?

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.080
Is that okay?

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.950
Why wouldn't it be okay?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:39.620
I'll be waiting off in the distance,
so wash all that muck off yourself.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.120
Thank you, I will!

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.620
Yell for me when you're finished.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.620
Okay!

00:07:55.700 --> 00:08:00.160
To think there was such a pretty
lake in the Forest of Wishes...

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:04.160
This is the first time in my life
I've dipped in water this clear!

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.750
I'm so glad to be alive right now!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.750
In any case, I wonder who
in the world that person is.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:19.700
Wh-What if he wants me to get clean
before he makes a meal of me?!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.700
"Administrator Privileges"
I can finally use administrator privileges!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.540
Administrator?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.330
Item file.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.200
Wh-What's that?!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:37.250
D-Do you think he's getting
out his cooking utensils?!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:40.750
Go on and use this bath towel and soap.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:45.410
Huh? Is this that thing they call <i>shabon</i>?

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:48.200
<i>Shabon</i>? What's this, the Edo period?

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.040
Edo period?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.040
Just forget it.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:55.830
Just to be safe, I'm going
to take a quick look around.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.290
My skill points are dropping, and fast...

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:11.290
Just like <i>Infinity Game</i>, you must get
points to learn skills through combat.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:15.250
But how am I going to build
points from here on out?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:21.750
Making those trash items used 5 points,
so I've got a bit over 30 left...

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:26.250
If this was the game, I should get
more or less points based on

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.830
my level difference with the enemy.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.700
D-Demon Lord.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:35.250
Thanks for waiting.
The <i>shabon </i>you gave me was wonderful.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:38.540
I keep telling you, I'm no Demon Lord.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:42.910
Anyways, do monsters like that
last one pop up around here often?

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.660
O-Of course not!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:48.620
If Greole showed up often, the whole
kingdom would get demolished!

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:52.330
What? You're saying he's
actually pretty dangerous?

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.700
Mm-hmm!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:58.950
Hmm... Aku, do you know where
his den is or where he sleeps?

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.500
I could use some more skill points to... Ahem!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.500
I'd like to investigate a bit.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:10.700
I heard Greole used to be sealed
at the Wishing Shrine in this forest.

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.000
Wishing Shrine, huh?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.580
Would you be able to guide me there?

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.250
A-All right.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:22.790
Huh?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.910
I'll carry you, so ride on my back.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:30.370
N-No way! You don't want someone
as filthy as me riding on your back!

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:32.870
Sorry, but I'm short on time.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.200
I won't ask again. Hurry up.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh, come on! You're so against it
that you cry? That really hurts...

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.000
For the longest time,
I've been a nuisance to the village.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.660
Which is why I gather all
the village's garbage...

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.830
...and throw out all the human waste.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:00.080
I've done the best that I can, but...

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:04.120
In other words, you do garbage disposal
and water treatment, right?

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.120
It's a very important job.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:10.830
But they... The villagers say
I'm dirty and smelly...

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:16.830
And then, they finally cast me out
as a sacrifice to Greole...

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:22.830
All the people in the village say
they'll get dirty if they touch me.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:23.870
That's why...!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.830
W-Wait! Hold on! If you touch me...

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.540
Nobody would get dirty
doing something like that.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:39.700
With bodies like ours, all it takes is
a wash and we're as good as new.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.700
Thank you very much, Demon Lord.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.750
Don't you think you're holding on a bit too tight?

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.200
I-I might be.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:12:00.750
But this is the first time I've
touched anyone like this before...

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:06.910
"Hakuto Kunai"
"Race: Human" "Sex: Male" "Age: 45" "Height: 187cm"

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:11.910
"Demon King Greole"
"Race: High Demon"

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.620
"Hakuto Kunai"
"Aku"

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.500
Can you read this, Aku?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.080
Wow! Demon Lord has pretty handwriting!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.580
You can tell that these are letters?

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.660
Of course.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.040
So you can read it then?

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:29.620
Hakuto Kunai... Aku...

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.620
One plus one equals two.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.330
G. A. M. E. Right?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.750
Yeah...

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:42.620
I'm not exactly sure the reason for it,
but our languages must be the same.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.330
It's safe to say we can communicate.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.660
By the way, is the Wishing Shrine
one of those places?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:52.200
The kind where you toss money in and pray?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.830
I'm not sure of all the details myself,

00:12:54.830 --> 00:13:00.910
but using the power of the shrine,
the Cherub managed to seal Greole there.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.410
The shrine's power?

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:08.620
Yeah, that's right. Legend says it can
grant the wishes of those who visit.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.250
Occult, is it?

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:15.620
I-If you go to the shrine, you could
obtain enough power to rule the world!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.200
I don't want that power!

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:24.620
"Wishing Shrine"

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.910
This smell...

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:32.910
Aku, wait right here.
It seems dangerous in there.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.120
O-Okay.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.870
So that's where the smell is coming from...

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:52.870
Bleh!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.330
I see...

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.290
You're the Demon Lord, indeed.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:09.370
"Idol"
I've granted many wishes thus far,
but I believe this will be my last.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:13.200
H-Hold up! What exactly do you know?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:16.700
Was it you who summoned me here?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:21.200
I suppose you could say
it was those people, not me.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:25.290
"We wish for the Demon Lord to descend."

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.580
These guys?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:32.580
And what else? Did those guys
ask you to summon Greole as well?

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:37.700
Greole broke the seal by
his own power and revived.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.950
He used the surrounding forests as his den...

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:45.290
...and demanded sacrifices
from the nearby villages.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.330
Sacrifices?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.000
They wished for the Demon Lord's descent,

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.370
but Greole appeared in order
to stop it from happening...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:00.330
...and slaughtered all of those people.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.000
Can you just return me to the world I came from?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.330
I cannot grant that wish.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.660
It defies a wish that was made.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.500
Huh?! No, it doesn't!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:17.450
However, as you are my final visitor,
I shall grant you this.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.410
Don't gimme this shit!

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:28.250
Having to wear a ring like this
sounds more like a punishment to me!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:32.830
I pray that your wish comes true...

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:37.250
I was once very pure and a sight to behold...

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:43.450
But many years of granting wicked
wishes to humans changed me to this.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:48.290
I pray that your... wish comes true...

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:55.950
What am I supposed to do with a ring like this?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:08.000
How was it? Did you wish for anything?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:12.870
Was it to rule the world after all?
Or perhaps some form of debauchery?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.620
Yoga! Yoga!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:21.410
Ouch, that hurts! Please stop it, Demon Lord!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:25.040
Aku, are there any large cities in the area?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.660
There's the Kingdom of Holy Light's
Holy Capital...

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:32.620
That's fine. Can you draw me a map or something?

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:37.410
D-Demon Lord! Does this mean you
don't want me to come with you?

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:40.580
Hmm? You want to come along?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.580
I-Is that a problem?

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:48.870
I mean, I can't just go home after
being cast out as a sacrifice...

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:53.660
It might come in handy having
someone from this world at my side...

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.040
Sure, why not?

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.370
Thank you very much!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:05.160
Could we possibly swing
by my village before we go?

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.910
It's not very much, but I have a few things.

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:10.000
All right.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.830
In that case, let's get going, Aku.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.500
It won't take long with your legs!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:22.370
If the situation is bad enough
to need sacrifices,

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:26.410
why hasn't the capital--rather,
the kingdom done anything?

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:29.830
This area is far from the Holy Capital, so...

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:32.750
I see. We must be way out there.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.580
Um, where do you come from, Demon Lord?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.790
W-Well, from way out there...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:44.120
The area around my village
is all withered from Greole's curse.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:48.080
Even the water under the soil
is seething with poison.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:52.040
That's why being able to bathe
in clean water like I did before

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.750
is a luxury I've never had in my life.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:18:00.040
Oh, Demon Lord!
My village is just inside that fence.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.950
My house is that way.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.660
"Stealth Stance"
Stealth Stance.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.790
Huh?

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.750
Player messaging feature.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.910
"Message"
Message. Aku, can you hear me?

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:34.450
H-Huh? I hear Demon Lord's
sinister voice in my head...

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:36.620
How dare you call it sinister!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:40.120
Don't worry about me. Just know I'm nearby.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.580
O-Okay!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:46.000
Hey, trash face. What are you doing here?

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.790
Did you think you could escape and come back?

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.660
--You're garbage!
--You pile of shit!

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.540
--Ow!
--Take that!

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.500
Those bastards!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:02.000
If they displease you, why not purge them?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:07.910
<i>I </i>have the authority to dispose
of any people you deem unbecoming.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:11.330
What the hell?
That's because it was only a game!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.620
It's a curious thing you say...

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:18.410
That authority, <i>Infinity Game</i>, that system...

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:24.700
That twisted country was made by
none other than yourself, was it not?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:31.120
It's you who is the root of all evil.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:36.620
If I'm a fiend who has purged
over 4 million people, then...

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.750
--...you are the one who leads
the world towards total destruction.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:42.790
--I'm hearing things...
I've got to be hearing things!
--...you are the one who leads
the world towards total destruction.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.120
Take that!

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:55.000
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.700
D-Don't tell me you're one of
Greole's underlings or something!

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:02.950
Please, spare our village!
We already offered a sacrifice!

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:13.160
Aku, hurry up and get your stuff.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.790
A-All right, Demon Lord.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.500
D-Did you say Demon Lord?!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.370
D-Demon Lord!

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.910
Aw, come on! Don't say stuff like that!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.160
Trash face!
You're screwing the village yet again!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.250
Piles of shit like you should get lost!
You're a plague!

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:39.660
Huh?

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:47.540
--My house!
--The lord will hear about this!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.660
Let's go, Aku.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.330
R-Right, Demon Lord.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.870
Sorry we couldn't get your things.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:01.160
More importantly,
was it all right to do all that?

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:05.500
D-Don't get me wrong.
I was just warming the place up.

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:09.750
You might even say that was an act of kindness!

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:15.330
D-Demon Lord... Why would you
rescue someone like me?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.160
Don't say someone like you.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.500
I think you're doing a swell job at living.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:24.910
Don't let other people
determine your worth for you.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:27.370
Demon Lord...

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:31.040
What do you think?
Did all that make you feel any better?

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:36.000
W-Well... I think I feel
just a little better now!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.660
Then let's get to this Holy Capital or whatever!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.540
Right!

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.580
Thanks for letting me come!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.330
"Super Top Secret"
"Don't let xxx read this!!! Or even see it (lol) Akira Oono"

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>I wish I could go back</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.580
Taken to another world.

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:23.250
One <i>Infinity Game </i>player
had this to say with a chuckle:

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:28.120
"These days, practically everyone is
getting in on the 'another world' genre."

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:35.200
I'd now like to speak on behalf of all
protagonists taken to another world...

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:39.370
"At least let me wipe
my hard drive before I go!"

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:42.200
What's a hard drive?

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:46.950
"Golden Luna"
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 2. "Golden Luna."
